    <string name="about_body">elichika is a private server for SIFAS (Love Live! School Idol Festival All Stars). This app runs the server, its WebUI, and the dev/modding tools on your phone — point the game at 127.0.0.1:8080.\n\nServer + dev tools by the elichika project (forks of YumeMichi / arina999999997 / tatara_hisoka). Modding tools: SIFAS-MODDING-HELPING-TOOLS.</string>

